:''This enemy has no official name.''
'''Rabbit Doge''' is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appeared in [[A Colossal New Year! (2022)|A Colossal New Year!]] during New Year's 2023. It was added in [[Version 12.0 Update|Version 12.0]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Rabbit Doge
|image = E 631.png
|appearance = [[A Colossal New Year! (2022)|A Colossal New Year!]]
|money drop = 150¢ - 592¢
}}

==Enemy==
This enemy is a Doge wearing a rabbit costume. It moves as fast as a [[Doge Dark]] but has ''slightly'' lower stats than it, making it a bit more threatening than a regular Doge. However, in its final debut levels, it is buffed to a point comparable to [[Killer Cat (Enemy)|Killer Cat]], albeit without the [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]] trait.

